EnerQit is independent of pvlib, IBM, D-Wave, and algorithm authors.
No affiliation or endorsement is implied.

pvlib-python is an external dependency under its own BSD-3-Clause license.
NumPy, SciPy, pandas, Matplotlib, Qiskit and dimod are external dependencies
under their respective licenses. They are not vendored in this source archive.

The repository layout follows pvlib conventions. Package code and examples were
written for this project; no pvlib source code or proprietary OEM curve library
is bundled. The simulated-bifurcation reference implementation follows the
published algorithm concept; it is not copied from a third-party implementation.

All bundled measurement data and all validation examples are synthetic.
